{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2021-10-18 14:52:00', 'title': 'LILLY DECLARES FOURTH-QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, OCT. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021 OF\xa0$0.85\xa0PER SHARE ON OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0DECEMBER 10, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0NOVEMBER 15, 2021.'}